      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUDDY BONUS (2) was out of the placings last time but before that was an impressive winner (20.03) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Good beginner and aided by a handy draw. Can make amends this time. YOU NEVER LOSE (4) boasts a consistent overall record including 17 wins from 55 starts, the latest hitting the minor money when third (17.36) over 300m at Taree Super Track. Solid record at this trip including nine wins. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. HE'S A BONUS (1) comes off an average run last start when sixth at this track over 450m behind Zippy Tippy (25.99) in a Grade 5. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. WIGGLE ON (8) looks a top-three hope after a break.",
